  "title": "Ziff Davis to Announce Second Quarter 2026 Earnings",
  "summary": "NEW YORK, July 16, 2026--Ziff Davis, Inc. (NASDAQ: ZD) will release its Second Quarter 2026 Earnings at 6:00PM ET on Thursday, August 6, 2026. Additionally, Ziff Davis invites the public, members of the press, the financial community, stockholders, and other interested parties to listen to a live audio Webcast of its Second Quarter 2026 Earnings Call at 8:30AM ET on Friday, August 7, 2026.",
